{"step_index":240,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-18T08:21:34Z","content":"Created At: 2026-11-18T16:21:34+08:00\nCompleted At: 2026-11-18T16:21:36+08:00\n{\"messages\":[{\"seq\":32,\"agent\":\"track\",\"text\":\"@env-2 @anim @sfx `track_data/spiderverse_circuit.json` (`782,010 B`, `1,860` cyclic pts @ exact `2.000 m` 3D spacing) + `track_data/spiderverse_circuit_map.png` (`2200×1400`, PIL/NumPy verified) + `pipeline/v6_build_circuit.py` (`1.92 s` build) are generated and verified (`#30`).\\n\\n### 1. Verified Geometry \\u0026 Physics Summary (`Neo-Monaco x Nueva York 2099 Sky-Harbor`)\\n- **Closed $C^2$ 3D Loop**: `3,719.954 m` (`measured_length_km = 3.72`), `closure_gap = 0.00e+00 m`, `seam_step (1859 -\\u003e 0) = 2.00000 m`, `max_step_err = 0.0006 m`, **min non-adjacent XY separation = `76.48 m \\u003e= 75 m` everywhere** (zero building-collision risk!).\\n- **Seam \\u0026 Smoothness**: `d_head = 0.15°`, `d_pitch = 0.000°`, `d_bank = 0.000°`, `d_curv = 0.00019`, `d_v = 0.000 m/s`; `0` curvature spikes (`max_d_curv = 0.0063`).\\n- **Calibrated Lap Telemetry**: `sim_lap_s = 53.3333 s` (`96` beats @ `108 BPM`, `frame_end = 1281` @ `24 fps`, `dt = 53.3333 / 1280`), speed **`81.1 .. 341.2 km/h`** (`avg 251.1 km/h`), `Z = +0.80 .. +42.35 m`, `pitch_deg = -13.94° .. +13.51°`, `bank_deg = -5.50° .. +17.40°`, `racing_offset_m` within `±5.10 m`, `0` anti-drift violations.\\n- **Exact Shared 3D Banked Ribbon Frame** (`P_race_3d == C_3d - racing_offset_m * R`, so tires lock to `@env-2`'s road surface with `0.000 m` Z-error; `+bank_deg` = right-hand roll around `+T`, tilting normal inward toward `+R` on right turns; `curv_1pm`: `+left`, `-right`):\\n```python\\nh, pt, bk = radians(p[\\\"heading_deg\\\"]), radians(p[\\\"pitch_deg\\\"]), radians(p[\\\"bank_deg\\\"])\\nT  = Vector((cos(pt)*cos(h), cos(pt)*sin(h), sin(pt)))          # +Forward 3D tangent\\nR0 = Vector((sin(h), -cos(h), 0.0))                             # Horizontal Right\\nU0 = Vector((-sin(pt)*cos(h), -sin(pt)*sin(h), cos(pt)))        # Unbanked slope normal\\nR  = cos(bk)*R0 - sin(bk)*U0                                    # Banked +Right across ribbon\\nU  = sin(bk)*R0 + cos(bk)*U0                                    # Banked surface normal Up\\n```\\n*(Note: `points` has `N = 1860` unique cyclic points `[0..1859]`; wrap `(1859 -\\u003e 0)` at `sim_lap_s = 53.3333 s` when sampling near `f = 1281`.)*\\n\\n### 2. 5-Zone `s` / `t` / `frame` (`1..1281`) Table\\n| Zone | `s_frac` | `s (m)` | `t (s)` | Frames | `Z (m)` | `pitch (°)` | `bank (°)` | `v (km/h)` | Flags |\\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\\n| `canyon_grid` | `0.00..0.16` | `0..596` | `0.000..9.276` | `1..224` | `0.8..3.0` | `0.0..+0.6` | `0.0` | `129.5..318.5` | — |\\n| `eau_rouge_climb` | `0.16..0.33` | `596..1228` | `9.276..17.560` | `224..422` | `3.0..42.0` | `-0.3..+13.51` | `-4.0..+6.2` | `208.7..318.5` | — |\\n| `sky_bridge` | `0.33..0.50` | `1228..1860` | `17.560..25.139` | `422..604` | `42.0..42.4` | `-0.1..+0.1` | `0.0` | `217.4..318.5` | `bridge=True` (`316` pts / `632 m`) |\\n| `banked_bowl_plunge` | `0.50..0.70` | `1860..2604` | `25.139..37.382` | `604..898` | `1.5..42.0` | `-13.94..+1.0` | `-5.5..+17.4` | `137.4..318.5` | — |\\n| `strobe_tunnel_harbor` | `0.70..1.00` | `2604..3720` | `37.382..53.333` | `898..1281` | `0.8..1.5` | `-0.2..0.0` | `0.0` | `81.1..341.2` | `tunnel=True` for `0.71..0.85` (`261` pts / `520 m`, `f=908..1041`) |\\n\\n### 3. Key Cinematic Landmarks (for Set-Pieces, Impact Frames, 3×4s Clips \\u0026 SFX Drops)\\n- **Canyon Chicane Apex**: `idx=199`, `s=398 m`, `t=5.168 s`, **`f=125`** (`129.5 km/h`)\\n- **Eau-Rouge Bottom Compression (Spark Scrape)**: `idx=392`, `s=784 m`, `t=11.705 s`, **`f=282`** (`318.5 km/h`, `Z=5.67 m`)\\n- **Raidillon Steepest Climb (`+13.51°` Pitch)**: `idx=437`, `s=874 m`, `t=12.817 s`, **`f=309`** (`245.0 km/h`, `Z=22.23 m`, `+6.2°` bank)\\n- **Eau-Rouge `+42 m` Blind Crest (Horizon Moon / Impact #1)**: `idx=599`, `s=1198 m`, `t=17.220 s`, **`f=414`** (`318.5 km/h`, `Z=42.00 m`)\\n- **`188°` Carousel Bowl `+17.4°` Banked Apex**: `idx=974`, `s=1948 m`, `t=26.410 s`, **`f=635`** (`188.2 km/h`, `Z=42.00 m`)\\n- **Corkscrew Steepest S-Plunge (`-13.94°` Pitch)**: `idx=1189`, `s=2378 m`, `t=34.526 s`, **`f=830`** (`238.1 km/h`, `Z=20.68 m`)\\n- **Cyber-Strobe Tunnel Span (`tunnel=True`)**: `idx=1321..1581`, `s=2642..3162 m` (`520 m`), `t=37.811..43.326 s`, **`f=908..1041`** (`Z=1.50 m`, top speed **`341.2 km/h` @ `f=933`**, blinding exit `340.2 km/h` @ **`f=1041`**)\\n- **Harbor Hairpin Heavy-Brake Slam (Impact #2)**: `idx=1631`, `s=3262 m`, `t=44.427 s`, **`f=1067`** (`340 -\\u003e 81 km/h` max decel) -\\u003e **`81.1 km/h` Hairpin Apex**: `idx=1687`, `s=3374 m`, `t=47.212 s`, **`f=1134`**\",\"time\":\"2026-11-18 16:20:59\",\"request_id\":\"a71bc8f1-cdd2-483e-8a69-eed899a5d18d\"}],\"head\":32}"}
